# Local test fixtures: realistic maps and token art, 100+ MB. Useful for exercising
# grid calibration against maps with a known square count, and the downscaler
# against a 21 MB source (CLAUDE.md invariant 6). Not repo content — this repo is
# public and Git is the wrong place for a folder of battlemaps.
docs/sample-images/

